  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Female Entrepreneurs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women Marketplace in the North State aims to empower women entrepreneurs and artisans, with a specific focus on local entrepreneurs, foster resilience, and contribute to their economic recovery. It is a three-day event during which the participants showcase their skills, products and services, make connections and establish partnerships with other entrepreneurs and potential customers, gain knowledge about entrepreneurship and foster a sense of resilience among women impacted by conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
